									th(scope="col") Minimum responsibility
							tbody
								tr
									th(scope="row") Team Lead
									td Overall control of this assessment, liaison with the Royal Society and festival, staffing and breaks, briefings, opening/closing approval, dynamic decisions, emergency coordination, radio and required records. Acts as person in charge; the named deputy covers absence.
								tr
									th(scope="row") Technical & Privacy Lead
									td Controls equipment configuration, sound and visual limits, batteries, fault isolation and technical records; verifies PhotoSYNTH’s real-time on-device processing with no video storage or transmission; maintains the participant privacy information; and liaises with the competent electrical contractor and data controller.
								tr
									th(scope="row") Access & Safeguarding Lead
									td Protects accessible routes and stations, coordinates reasonable adjustments, oversees consent and participant welfare, receives safeguarding concerns and follows the agreed reporting route.
								tr
