									td Coordinates induction/accreditation, access and deliveries, set-up/pack-down, front of house, capacity and queues, housekeeping, cleaning, inventory and daily checklists. Confirms all four team members follow briefings, report defects/incidents and use stop-work authority.
					p.source-note These combined team roles do not replace external duties. The Royal Society and each employer remain responsible for their undertaking; the festival retains site access, traffic, emergency, medical, security and fire control; and the tent supplier, competent electrical contractor and data controller retain decisions requiring their authority or competence.
