					p
						strong Method: 
						| Risk score = likelihood × severity. Scores are recorded before and after the specified controls. Severity is not reduced merely because controls make occurrence less likely.
					.table-scroll(tabindex="0", aria-label="Scrollable table: 4. Risk scoring and acceptance")
