								+actionRow("A12", "A", "Obtain and integrate the responsible person’s suitable and sufficient fire-risk assessment for the tent/activity, including occupancy, escape capacity, alarm, emergency lighting, fire performance of fabric/furnishings, ignition sources, firefighting arrangements and staff instruction. Confirm applicable premises-licence conditions.", "Fire responsible person + Team Lead")
								+actionRow("A13", "A", "Complete first-aid needs assessments and name each contractor’s first aider. Brief that there is no on-site medic during build/break: contact festival management on channel 2. For show days confirm Event Control channel 1, festival medical provision, response route, accessibility and handover arrangements.", "Employers + Festival medical lead")
								+actionRow("A14", "A", "Obtain the festival protective-security plan and brief staff on suspicious behaviour/items, lockdown, invacuation, evacuation and communications. Confirm who is the responsible person for any applicable Terrorism (Protection of Premises) Act duties and check commencement status before the event; do not treat this tent assessment as the festival-level assessment.", "Festival security + Team Lead")
								+actionRow("A15", "A", "Submit the required contractor pack: company H&S policy; RAMS/safe systems; relevant driver/plant certificates; structure drawings/calculations; flame-retardancy certification; adverse-weather/wind plan; employers’ and public-liability insurance; first-aider details; and crew-boss name/mobile. Use healthandsafety@festivalrepublic.com if no submission request has been received.", "Team Lead + Royal Society")
								+actionRow("A16", "A", "Obtain induction-confirmation emails, accreditation and Site Office authorisation for every worker/vehicle. Brief Pink Gate routing, prohibited villages, no Sat Nav, 10 mph limit, Hazz-Off rule, Trakway/hard-standing use, banksman requirement, 08:00 show-day vehicle curfew and delivery receiver/collection arrangements.", "Operations & Logistics Lead")
								+actionRow("A17", "A", "Nominate the person in charge for the event; provide the Site Office with crew mobile numbers and a 24-hour contractor emergency number; arrange the required radio in advance; collect its channel list; and brief that the radio must remain active while responsible for event cover.", "Team Lead")
								+actionRow("A18", "A", "Brief site environmental and welfare rules: bring refillable water bottles; use only designated cleaning/washing points; contain grey water; report spills immediately; use provided sanitation and waste facilities; and arrange any fuel transfer through the Site Office.", "Operations & Logistics Lead")
