						span 6. Detailed risk register
					p.source-note The PhotoSYNTH/Sound Connections hazard table supplied for this assessment is the baseline for this register. Its hazards and practical controls are incorporated below and extended for Camp Bestival Dorset 2026.
					aside.callout
						strong Residual-risk condition:
						|  Residual scores assume every listed control is in place, effective and verified. If a control is missing or conditions change, use the initial score as the starting point, pause where required and complete a dynamic reassessment.
