						h4 Required controls
						ul
							li Staff lead and direct moving and handling. Brief any person assisting, plan the route and use wheeled cases, trolleys or other suitable aids wherever practicable.
							li Do not move a heavy, bulky or awkward item alone. Use at least two people unless a suitable mechanical aid removes the need for a team lift; stop and obtain more help whenever the load, route or individual capability requires it.
