						h4 Required controls
						ul
							li Submit power requirements to festival production in advance. Use only a festival-approved supply installed and verified by a competent person, with appropriate earthing, overcurrent protection and 30 mA RCD protection where required.
							li Do not connect equipment that does not meet current regulations; there are no exceptions under the contractor guide. Isolate any rejected item and resolve it through the Technical & Privacy Lead and festival power contractor.
							li The original assessment identified a possible monitor without current PAT/inspection evidence and proposed relying on visual inspection because participants would not touch it. That exception is not permitted: replace it with compliant equipment or obtain competent inspection/testing evidence before connection.
